43 Remarks: This is a computer generated document. No signature is required. This order is subject to the Terms and Conditions as attached herein which the supplier is deemed to have notice thereof. Purchase Order P.O. No. : 4700304767 Date : 09.01.2026 Payment Term : Net 30 days Incoterm :Delivered at Place ( As per delivery address ) Contact Info : Requestor Name : Jun Liang TAN, Tel : 65101655 Creator Name : Ying Ting Yeo, Tel : Billing Instruction: All invoices must be submitted via www.vendors.gov.sg with attached supporting documents, where necessary for prompt payment.Please select Ministry/Statutory Board: STC ; Department: ARES ; Sub-Business Unit: ARTC ; (Please quote PO no. when issuing Invoice/DO) Page : 1 of 1 ITEM DESCRIPTION DEL. DATE QUANTITY UOM UNIT TOTAL PRICE AMOUNT SGD SGD","confidence":0.9,"provider":"client_pdfjs"}','{"documentType":"purchase_order","confidence":0.9,"possibleTypes":[{"documentType":"purchase_order","confidence":0.9}],"reason":"The document is a purchase order from Axiom Tech Pte Ltd to A*STAR Research Entities, with a purchase order number and details of the items to be purchased.","modelId":"workers_ai","promptVersion":"document-intake-classify-v2","schemaVersion":"v2"}','{"abandonedAt":"2026-05-29T02:30:19.583Z","abandonedBy":"52pIJmXZ5RnC4oXCIFsAzodyNBwBb2Ff","abandonReason":"cancelled_from_inbox_processing","previousStatus":"classification_pending","fileRetention":"retained_for_audit_cleanup"}','["untrusted_external_content"]',24104,'2026-05-29T01:57:53.955Z','2026-05-29T02:30:19.583Z',NULL,NULL,NULL);
