ce Discount Total Price 1 SVC-PJT-20001 3D print Bond Head & Adapter Bracket with material of 1 NOS 850.90 0.00 850.90 DO: DO26-00072 DD 26/02/2026 engineering resin (draft grey), around +/- 100um accuracy Remarks: -The drawing files are attached for your reference. - Please increase the hole size and depth to accommodate the insertion of four M4 screws (photo attached) Total Sales Total Line Discount Additional Discount Total before GST 9 % GST Total SGD 850.90 0.00 0.00 850.90 76.58 927.48 Exchange Rate 1.00000 GST in SGD 76.58 approx SGD : NINE HUNDRED TWENTY SEVEN AND CENTS FORTY EIGHT ONLY : : Received the above mentioned items in good order and condition. For Cheque Payment , Please cross payable to CREATZ3D PTE LTD For PayNow, Please input UEN No.: 201219797H For Bank Transfer, United Overseas Bank Limited A/c Name: Creatz3D Pte Ltd A/c No: 362-302-316-6 (SGD), 362-900-444-9 (USD) Bank code/Branch code: 7375/032 Swift code: UOVBSGSG All local and overseas bank charges to be borne and paid by customer. Creatz3D should receive the amount in full per invoice(s). Creatz3D Pte Ltd 180 Paya Lebar Road, #08-07, Yi Guang Factory Building, Singapore 409032 Tel : (+65) 6631 8555 Fax : (+65) 6747-1760 ROC Reg.: 201219797H ; GST Reg.: 201219797H TAX INVOICE No. Date Cust PO Ref. Pages : L202600052 : 26/02/2026 : PO26-0002-0216 : 1 of 2 Sales Person Sally Chuen Payment Terms Cash On Delivery Incoterms EXW Shipping Details Sally Chuen Currency SGD BILLING ADDRESS Axiom Tech Pte Ltd Blk 5008, Ang Mo Kio Ave 5, #04-09 (W58), Techplace II, Singapore 569874 URL : https:/www.creatz3d.com.sg E-mail : accounts@creatz3d.com : : Accounts Payables : Tel Attn Fax\r\nNote : Any discrepancies in this invoice should be lodged within 7 days from the date of invoice, otherwise the invoice amount will be treated as true and correct. Interest of 3% per month will be levied on all account due beyond 7 days. This is a computer generated Sales Invoice. No signature is required. E. & O.E. Created By : CANDYCHOY Creatz3D Pte Ltd 180 Paya Lebar Road, #08-07, Yi Guang Factory Building, Singapore 409032 Tel : (+65) 6631 8555 Fax : (+65) 6747-1760 ROC Reg.: 201219797H ; GST Reg.: 201219797H TAX INVOICE No. Date Cust PO Ref. Pages : L202600052 : 26/02/2026 : PO26-0002-0216 : 2 of 2 Sales Person Sally Chuen Payment Terms Cash On Delivery Incoterms EXW Shipping Details Sally Chuen Currency SGD BILLING ADDRESS Axiom Tech Pte Ltd Blk 5008, Ang Mo Kio Ave 5, #04-09 (W58), Techplace II, Singapore 569874 URL : https:/www.creatz3d.com.sg E-mail : accounts@creatz3d.com : : Accounts Payables : Tel Attn Fax","confidence":0.9,"provider":"client_pdfjs"}','{"documentType":"supplier_invoice","confidence":0.9,"possibleTypes":[{"documentType":"supplier_invoice","confidence":0.9}],"reason":"The document is a tax invoice from Creatz3D Pte Ltd to Axiom Tech Pte Ltd, indicating a payment owed to the issuer.","modelId":"workers_ai","promptVersion":"document-intake-classify-v2","schemaVersion":"v2"}',NULL,'["untrusted_external_content"]',649558,'2026-05-29T01:58:01.598Z','2026-05-29T01:58:51.564Z',NULL,'{"fields":{"invoice_number":"L202600052","supplier_name":"CREATZ3D PTE LTD","date":"2026-02-26","due_date":"2026-02-26","amount":927.48,"currency":"SGD","gst_amount":76.58},"confidence":{"invoice_number":1,"supplier_name":1,"date":1,"due_date":1,"amount":1,"currency":1,"gst_amount":1},"evidence":[{"type":"extracted_field","refId":"workers_ai://invoice_number","summary":"Extracted invoice_number via workers_ai"},{"type":"extracted_field","refId":"workers_ai://supplier_name","summary":"Extracted supplier_name via workers_ai"},{"type":"extracted_field","refId":"workers_ai://date","summary":"Extracted date via workers_ai"},{"type":"extracted_field","refId":"workers_ai://due_date","summary":"Extracted due_date via workers_ai"},{"type":"extracted_field","refId":"workers_ai://amount","summary":"Extracted amount via workers_ai"},{"type":"extracted_field","refId":"workers_ai://currency","summa